    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your wife is a desktop pet game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Instructions:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports gaze tracking with the mouse, dragging, and zooming in and out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drag with the left mouse button and use the scroll wheel to zoom in and out during the drag process.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dual screen players can switch the screen where their wife is located by using the win key, shift key, and left/right keys.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Contents:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game includes a cute desktop pet character.</p>",
